prompt.en:
A teammate shipped these endpoints. Rewrite each one resource-oriented, with the verb in the HTTP method (or modeled as a sub-resource), and explain the choice. Then reveal the model answer.

POST /createUser            {name, email}
POST /getUserById          {id}
POST /updateUserEmail      {id, email}
GET  /listActiveUsers
POST /cancelOrder          {orderId}
POST /refundPayment        {paymentId, amount}

